WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.086 --> 00:00:02.914
Roxy arrived downtown.

2
00:00:02.915 --> 00:00:06.064
Detective Smith waved to her.

3
00:00:06.065 --> 00:00:08.842
Next to him she saw a strange creature.

4
00:00:08.843 --> 00:00:11.340
It was eating out of a garbage can.

5
00:00:11.341 --> 00:00:16.532
"A mushroom monster!" Roxy thought.

6
00:00:16.533 --> 00:00:18.294
"Burp!"

7
00:00:18.295 --> 00:00:22.843
"Excuse yourself, Detective," Roxy said.

8
00:00:22.844 --> 00:00:24.978
Detective Smith rolled his eyes.

9
00:00:24.979 --> 00:00:29.597
"I didn't burp, Rocket Girl. That thing did."

10
00:00:29.598 --> 00:00:33.151
"Why is it eating garbage?" Roxy asked.

11
00:00:33.152 --> 00:00:36.155
"Who knows?" Detective Smith said.

12
00:00:36.156 --> 00:00:40.984
"Mayor Bloom said there are lots of mushroom monsters around," Roxy said.

13
00:00:40.985 --> 00:00:43.143
"Do you know where they came from?"

14
00:00:43.144 --> 00:00:45.066
Detective Smith shrugged.

15
00:00:45.067 --> 00:00:48.867
"An explorer in Waxcap Cave got slime on her boot.

16
00:00:48.868 --> 00:00:52.728
By the next morning, the slime had turned into a mushroom monster.

17
00:00:52.729 --> 00:00:55.818
Now they're everywhere."

18
00:00:55.819 --> 00:00:58.053
The monster kept eating.

19
00:00:58.054 --> 00:01:02.031
Roxy noticed a lump growing out of its back. Pop!

20
00:01:02.032 --> 00:01:03.982
The lump fell to the ground.

21
00:01:03.983 --> 00:01:07.753
Now it was a baby mushroom monster with arms and legs!

22
00:01:07.754 --> 00:01:09.946
"Gorp!" it said.

23
00:01:09.947 --> 00:01:14.630
"Aww," Roxy said. "It's kind of cute."

24
00:01:14.631 --> 00:01:18.709
"It's not cute, Rocket Girl!" Detective Smith frowned.

25
00:01:18.710 --> 00:01:20.427
"These things grow fast.

26
00:01:20.428 --> 00:01:22.619
How are we going to get rid of them?"

27
00:01:22.620 --> 00:01:25.537
A man was walking down the street, eating an apple.

28
00:01:25.538 --> 00:01:27.934
Another mushroom monster appeared.

29
00:01:27.935 --> 00:01:31.581
It snatched the apple out of his hand. Crunch!

30
00:01:31.582 --> 00:01:35.923
"Ahh!" People screamed in fear and ran away.

31
00:01:35.924 --> 00:01:38.267
Detective Smith grabbed the creature's arm.

32
00:01:38.268 --> 00:01:40.758
"All right, buddy. That's enough!"

33
00:01:40.759 --> 00:01:42.771
The mushroom monster yanked it away.

34
00:01:42.772 --> 00:01:46.625
"Whoa!" Detective Smith lost his balance and fell.

35
00:01:46.626 --> 00:01:50.430
"Stop that, mushroom monster!" Roxy said.

36
00:01:50.431 --> 00:01:55.070
The creature turned to Roxy, looking scared. "Gorp! Gorp!"

37
00:01:55.071 --> 00:01:58.649
"Eating garbage is one thing," Roxy said.

38
00:01:58.650 --> 00:02:01.142
"But you need to be careful around people.

39
00:02:01.143 --> 00:02:03.248
You might hurt someone."

40
00:02:03.249 --> 00:02:05.774
The creature looked confused.

41
00:02:05.775 --> 00:02:10.261
"You're coming with me!" Detective Smith tried to grab the monster again.

42
00:02:10.262 --> 00:02:12.164
But the monster ran away.

43
00:02:12.165 --> 00:02:19.386
Detective Smith sighed. "Rocket Girl, we need to . . . Rocket Girl?"

44
00:02:19.387 --> 00:02:21.866
A garbage truck was on its way to the dump.

45
00:02:21.867 --> 00:02:25.996
When it stopped at a light, a mushroom monster ran over.

46
00:02:25.997 --> 00:02:29.404
It jumped into the back. Thunk!

47
00:02:29.405 --> 00:02:32.974
"Did you hear something, Grover?" the driver asked.

48
00:02:32.975 --> 00:02:37.076
"No, Ernie." The other garbage collector shrugged.

49
00:02:37.077 --> 00:02:43.286
"Let's just get to the dump and get rid of this garbage."

50
00:02:43.287 --> 00:02:46.769
At the dump Ernie tilted the container. Slorp!

51
00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:49.951
The mushroom monster slid out with the garbage.

52
00:02:49.952 --> 00:02:52.867
It looked around and grinned.

53
00:02:52.868 --> 00:02:55.479
There was garbage everywhere!

54
00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:57.886
"Gorp!"

55
00:02:57.887 --> 00:03:03.352
As the truck left, the mushroom monster started running around, eating garbage.

56
00:03:03.353 --> 00:03:05.310
Lumps appeared on its back.

57
00:03:05.311 --> 00:03:13.992
Pop! Pop! Pop! The lumps popped off—and turned into baby mushroom monsters!

